      "id": "txt_0131",
      "reading_order": 145,
      "section": "/page/22/SectionHeader/1",
      "content": "NOTE: When installing a replacement toner cartridge, hold both ends of the toner cartridge and rock",
      "severity": "note"
    },
    {
